{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>May He add to you a thousand times.</b> What is the meaning of then again <b>and may He bless you as He spoke to you</b>? Rather, they said to him: Moses, are you setting a limit to our blessings? The Holy One, blessed be He, already promised Abraham 'if a man can count…' (Genesis 13). He said to them: This is from me — but He will bless you as He spoke to you (Sifrei)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:45:23.520271158Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}